[I] A free, multiplatform UPnP A/V Media Server

[T] FUPPES supports a wide range of UPnP MediaRenderers as well as on-the-fly
[T] transcoding of various audio, video and image formats. FUPPES also includes
[T] basic DNLA support.

[U] https://github.com/uvoelkel/fuppes

[A] Ulrich Völkel <fuppes@ulrich-voelkel.de>
[M] Adam Stirk <adam.stirk@brantano.co.uk>

[C] extra/multimedia

[E] opt flac
[E] opt lame

[L] GPL
[V] r627

[D] d317563631e3e3c05b6099d3fe02eda12d4cdb3d348c741044997a54 fuppes-r627.tar.gz svn+https://svn.code.sf.net/p/fuppes/code/trunk/ fuppes -r627

